WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.061
(mellow relaxing music)

00:00:02.061 --> 00:00:03.292
- [Narrator] It's Thanksgiving;

00:00:03.292 --> 00:00:05.381
turkey, stuffing, mashed potatoes,

00:00:05.381 --> 00:00:07.320
but the one thing that
has always stood out

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:08.841
is a bit of a head scratcher:

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:11.174
sweet potato casserole, mmm.

00:00:13.668 --> 00:00:15.624
We're pretty sure sweet
potatoes and marshmallows

00:00:15.624 --> 00:00:17.876
weren't at the original Thanksgiving.

00:00:17.876 --> 00:00:19.269
So what happened?

00:00:19.269 --> 00:00:21.696
Sweet potatoes have been around forever.

00:00:21.696 --> 00:00:23.971
And marshmallows, this sticky, gooey mess

00:00:23.971 --> 00:00:25.701
actually comes from a plant

00:00:25.701 --> 00:00:28.128
and has been around since ancient Egypt.

00:00:28.128 --> 00:00:30.496
A delicacy only pharaohs could eat.

00:00:30.496 --> 00:00:32.704
Okay, fast forward to the 20th century.

00:00:32.704 --> 00:00:34.571
Marshmallows were a big deal,

00:00:34.571 --> 00:00:38.879
expensive, and essentially
the Cristal of sweet treats.

00:00:38.879 --> 00:00:41.479
Not only that, but they
were even hand made.

00:00:41.479 --> 00:00:44.556
Marshmallows became a mainstay
for highfalutin housewives.

00:00:44.556 --> 00:00:48.074
See, back then, housewives
would have to make whipped cream

00:00:48.074 --> 00:00:49.966
or even meringue by hand,

00:00:49.966 --> 00:00:52.845
but the marshmallows
were a modern time saver.

00:00:52.845 --> 00:00:54.738
The first recipe that
paired sweet potatoes

00:00:54.738 --> 00:00:57.605
and marshmallows appeared in 1918

00:00:57.605 --> 00:01:01.773
in a trade journal, cleverly
named Sweet Potatoes and Yams.

00:01:01.773 --> 00:01:03.503
As marshmallows grew in popularity

00:01:03.503 --> 00:01:04.931
and began being mass produced,

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:07.648
more and more recipes
began implementing them

00:01:07.648 --> 00:01:09.715
as an everyday ingredient.

00:01:09.715 --> 00:01:11.537
Nowadays, marshmallows are generally

00:01:11.537 --> 00:01:13.883
reserved for campfires and hot chocolate,

00:01:13.883 --> 00:01:16.936
and this nontraditional/
traditional favorite.

00:01:16.936 --> 00:01:18.097
Whether you like your sweet potatoes

00:01:18.097 --> 00:01:19.606
a la marshmallow or plain,

00:01:19.606 --> 00:01:21.040
happy Thanksgiving!

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:24.623
(mid-tempo relaxing music)

